cmm:RegulatoryFiling.regulatoryObligation a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:label "regulatory obligation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Foreign key linking to compliance.obligation. Business justification: Each regulatory filing fulfills a specific regulatory obligation (e.g., annual FERC Form 1, quarterly PUC financial reports). Many filings can fulfill one obligation (1:N). Adding obligation_id FK lin"@en ;
